OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief misleading on migrant
OL,4,Acrime - Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has accused Essex Police's
OL,7,Fchief constable of "misleading" people
OL,8,Fabout how many crimes are committed by
OL,9,Fasylum seekers.
OL,11,FThe Reform UK leader said Rachel Nolan
OL,12,Fwas "completely wrong" to say nobody
OL,13,Fshould be concerned about criminality
OL,14,Ffrom migrants housed at a base in MDP
OL,15,FWethersfield in north Essex.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
