OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief misleading on migrant
OL,4,Acrime - Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNolan said crime linked to the
OL,7,Faccommodation near Braintree was "very
OL,8,Flow", with 15 offences since 2023 in
OL,9,Fwhich a member of the public was the
OL,10,Fvictim and the suspect was identified
OL,11,Fas, or alleged to be, a Wethersfield
OL,12,F"service user".
OL,14,FAn Essex Police spokesman said
OL,15,Fincidents relating to asylum seekers
OL,16,Fthere "remain low".
